      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. If the holder\nbecomes infatuated, the opposing Pokémon will\nbe, too.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "細くて　長い　真っ赤な　糸。\n持たせると　メロメロに　なったとき\n相手も　メロメロに　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "长长的鲜红色细线。\n携带后，在自己着迷时\n能让对手也着迷。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
